    "name": "REDX Open Areas Pickup Stores API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "REDX Open API lets merchants integrate with REDX — the last-mile delivery and courier network operated by ShopUp — to create and track parcels and to manage pickup stores across Bangladesh. Authentication uses a merchant API access token passed in the API-ACCESS-TOKEN header.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: REDX Developer API",
